            <ArticleTitle>[Estrogen therapy after menopause and cardiovascular protection: discordance between epidemiologic observations and the results of therapeutic trials] .</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>886-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Based upon the positive results of a large epidemiological study and the negative results of an interventional clinical trial recently published in the New England Journal of Medicine, we will briefly discuss the impact of estrogen replacement therapy on the protection against coronary heart disease in postmenopausal women.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
